* The jBASE manual specifies the default and how PRECISION changes it.
CRT DROUND(1.23456)
CRT DROUND(1.2345678, 5)
CRT DROUND('9.995', 2)
CRT DROUND('-9.995', 2)
CRT DROUND('-0.004', 2)
CRT DROUND(2.5, 0)
CRT DROUND(3.14159265358979323846, 19)
CRT DROUND('2.0', 1000000000)
PRECISION 2
CRT DROUND(1.235)
CRT DROUND(1.234567, 5)
CRT DROUND('1.234', 2) + 0.009
